<title>LATVIA: BRASA DEBTS CAPITALISED.</title>
<headline>BRASA DEBTS CAPITALISED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation agency on Friday said that it decided to capitalise the tax debts of the Brasa furniture maker worth 305,000 lats and write off late payment fines worth 151,974 lats.</p>
<p>A social tax debt of 84,586 lats, 52,730 lats of turnover tax and 50,331 of profit tax are among the main constituents of Brasa's tax debt, the agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>Brasa is a small secondary list stock on the Riga stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
